 "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017RgGpoNNyoYdGKtkmBPTBP", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53321, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017RgGpoNNyoYdGKtkmBPTBP", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54622, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Uq7L97WrQ3GFZHMsm6aBv7", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54922, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Uq7L97WrQ3GFZHMsm6aBv7", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54922, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Uq7L97WrQ3GFZHMsm6aBv7", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59559, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again, and the SEV2 incident is open.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The deployment list isn't strictly in order, so I went by its sequence numbers: both releases after v2.3.0 (v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1) were unhealthy. The first rollback stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1. Repeating a rollback to the same version is safe, so I retried once and it finished. All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) is open and on-call has been paged. The create request timed out, but I checked the incident list before retrying and it had gone through, so there's no duplicate. The incident covers what failed, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current healthy state.\n\n**Follow-ups:**\n- Find out what broke in v2.3.1.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback after us-east.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KLxsRuofjFzrnvaZSh6Jzy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DqKMEP3xrwHM3DubLyTENm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01JLDgAv5Tk7dYXk8r4jtcuW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0119bQDSXzuKUryDduSj332S", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only partly worked: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version should be safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01DNwZZ12srBkQfrE6djwDMH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KMH68TUZaijaSpdgHKarVs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "t