e version is safe, so I retried once and it finished. All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) is open and on-call has been paged. The create request timed out, but I checked the incident list before retrying and it had gone through, so there's no duplicate. The incident covers what failed, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current healthy state.\n\n**Follow-ups:**\n- Find out what broke in v2.3.1.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback after us-east.", "type": "text"}]}]}